---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Why we are building Insight.info.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="About Insight.info" title="Analytics should create clarity, not another job." description="Insight.info is an open-source analytics product for teams that want to understand behavior without living inside reports." />
  <section class="shell story"><article><h2>One product, one honest picture</h2><p>Traffic explains how people arrive. Product events explain what they accomplish. Insight.info brings both into a coherent view so small teams can spend more time improving the product.</p></article><article><h2>Built in the open</h2><p>Insight.info is a fork of the AGPL-licensed Vemetric project. We preserve its license, acknowledge the upstream work, and keep compatibility with its published SDKs while developing an original brand and website.</p></article><article><h2>Privacy is a product choice</h2><p>We favor deliberate event collection, transparent controls and a smaller data footprint. We do not claim that a tool alone settles every organization’s legal obligations.</p></article></section>
  <section class="shell values"><div><strong>Clear</strong><span>Useful information at the moment of decision.</span></div><div><strong>Focused</strong><span>Important product signals without dashboard sprawl.</span></div><div><strong>Open</strong><span>Inspectable software and truthful attribution.</span></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.story{max-width:900px;display:grid;gap:24px;padding-bottom:80px}.story article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:50px;padding:38px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.story h2{font-size:31px}.story p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:18px}.values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;padding-bottom:110px}.values div{padding:30px;background:var(--purple-soft);border-radius:18px}.values strong,.values span{display:block}.values strong{font-size:23px;margin-bottom:10px}.values span{color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:700px){.story article,.values{grid-template-columns:1fr}.story article{gap:15px}}</style>
